      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COMPTON LAYLA (1) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.92 beating Rocket Susie. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and eight minor placings to her credit. Can continue on her winning ways. MINNIE'S MY MUM (7) turned in a moderate effort last time when sixth at this track over 400m behind Cheques To Burn (23.56) in a Grade 3/4/5. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Leading chance. CANTARA PEARL (8) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last four runs. Last time finished 2nd on July 23 over 305m at this track behind Fernando Lee beaten 4.5 lengths (18.14) in a Other. Expecting another good run. ROUGH GIRL MEL (2) is a last-start placegetter who should be thereabouts.",
